      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomyaka wetshumi lesificaminwembili wokubusa kukaJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda uJehoramu indodana kaAhabi waba yinkosi yakoIsrayeli eSamariya; wabusa iminyaka elitshumi lambili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okubi phambi kweNkosi lanxa engafanananga loyise lonina, ngoba yena wasusa insika ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " eyayenziwe nguyise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwake wanamathela esonweni sikaJerobowamu indodana kaNebati esenza uIsrayeli one, kasukanga kuso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UMesha inkosi yaseMowabi wayengumfuyi wezimvu, wayeletha enkosini yakoIsrayeli iminyaka yonke amawundlu azinkulungwane ezilikhulu, loboya bezinqama ezizinkulungwane ezilikhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi esefile uAhabi, inkosi yaseMowabi yavukela inkosi yakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uJehoramu yaphuma eSamariya, yahlomisa wonke uIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathumela ilizwi kuJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda yathi: Inkosi yaseMowabi isingivukele; uzahamba lami ukulwa leMowabi na? Yena wathi: Ngizahamba. Okwami ngokwakho, lami uqobo labantu bami kanye lamabhiza ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasisithi: Sizahamba ngayiphi indlela na? UJehoramu waphendula wathi: Ngendlela yasenkangala yaseEdoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasihamba inkosi yakoIsrayeli lenkosi yakoJuda lenkosi yaseEdoma. Sebehambe insuku eziyisikhombisa, kwaphela amanzi empi lawezifuyo ezithwalayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yakoIsrayeli yasisithi: Maye! INkosi uNkulunkulu isihlanganisile thina makhosi amathathu ukusinikela ezandleni zamaMowabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wasesithi: Kakulamprofethi weNkosi lapha esingabuza ngaye iNkosi na? Enye yezinceku zenkosi yakoIsrayeli yathi: Kukhona lapha uElisha indodana kaShafati owayeyinceku kaElija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoshafati wathi: Ilizwi leNkosi likuye. Inkosi yakoIsrayeli loJehoshafati lenkosi yaseEdoma baya kuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wathi enkosini yakoIsrayeli: Ufunani kimi na? Hamba kubaprofethi bakayihlo labakanyoko. Kodwa inkosi yakoIsrayeli yathi kuye: Atshi, yiNkosi uNkulunkulu ehlanganise lamakhosi amathathu ukuwanikela ezandleni zamaMowabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UElisha wathi: Ngifunga iNkosi yamabandla engiyikhonzayo, uba bengingahloniphi uJehoshafati inkosi yakoJuda, bengingayikukukhangela lokuwukhangela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwake ngibizelani umtshayi wechacho. Kwathi umtshayi wechacho eselitshaya, amandla eNkosi ehlela kuElisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: INkosi ithi: Yenzani imithombo eminengi kulesisifula esomileyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lanxa lingayikubona umoya lezulu, kodwa lesisifula sizagcwala amanzi ukuze linathe lina, lenkomo zenu lezifuyo zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lokhu kuyinto encinyane nje eNkosini. Izanikela lamaMowabi ezandleni zenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lizanqoba yonke imizi ebiyelweyo lemizi yonke emihle, ligamule zonke izihlahla ezinhle, ligqibele yonke imithombo yamanzi, lone ngamatshe amasimu wonke avundileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi kusisa ngesikhathi sokunikelwa komnikelo kwafika amanzi evelela eEdoma, ilizwe lonke lagcwala amanzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonke amaMowabi esezwile ukuthi amakhosi afikile ukuwahlasela, wonke ayengahloma kusukela kwamancinyane kusiya kwamadala abuthwa, ayamisa ngasemngceleni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avuka ekuseni kakhulu. Kwathi ilanga selikhanya emanzini, amaMowabi abona amanzi phambi kwawo ebomvu njengegazi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "athi: Ligazi leli; amakhosi alwile impela aze abulalana. Ziphangele, Mowabi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi efika ezihonqweni zabakoIsrayeli, abakoIsrayeli bawasukela bawatshaya, aze abaleka; bangena elizweni lamaMowabi baqhubekela phambili bewabulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayichitha imizi, kuwo wonke amasimu avundileyo abantu bonke baphosela amatshe aze agcwala, bagqibela yonke imithombo yamanzi, bagamula zonke izihlahla ezinhle, kwaze kwasala izindlu eKiri‐Haresethi kuphela, abaphosa ngezavutha baligombolozela iKiri‐Haresethi, balichitha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yaseMowabi isibonile ukuba iyehlulwa empini, yathatha abantu abahlome ngemihedla abangamakhulu ayisikhombisa ukuba ifohle maqondana lenkosi yaseEdoma, kodwa behluleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasithatha indodana yayo elizibulo eyayizakuba yinkosi esikhundleni sayo, yayinikela yaba ngumnikelo wokutshiswa phezu komduli womuzi. Bethuswa kakhulu yilokho abakoIsrayeli, basuka babuyela elizweni lakibo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
